#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/datasets/earth_deflection.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.datasets.earth_deflection.load_earth_deflection:56
msgid ""
"*grid* -- The Earth east-west or north-south deflection grid. Coordinates "
"are latitude and longitude in degrees. Deflection values are in micro-"
"radians, where positive (negative) values indicate a deflection to the east "
"or north (west or south)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/datasets/earth_deflection.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.datasets.earth_deflection.load_earth_deflection:63
msgid ""
"The registration and coordinate system type of the returned :class:`xarray."
"DataArray` grid can be accessed via the *gmt* accessor. Refer to :class:"
"`pygmt.GMTDataArrayAccessor` for detailed explanations and limitations."
msgstr ""

